0035:     - Stations = 8-connected 9-clusters not adjacent to any 8. Trains = components containing 8.
0036:     - Match train to station group where |couplers| == |station size|.
0037:     - Rotate/flip train so marker pixels face the same-color boundary stripe of the target region.
