0108:       anchors, using their spacing as the period, and draw the outer top and
0109:       bottom borders in the first right-control color.
0110:     - Repeat the below-side control bars vertically between the top and bottom
0111:       anchors, using the same period, and draw the outer left and right borders
0112:       in the first below-control color.
